    "chunk_text": "NOTICE CALLING FOR CLAIMS TO PROPERTY OF INTESTATE REGISTRATION OF TITLE ACT, NO. 21 OF 1998 (SECTION 55) Reference the intestate property of late Mr. Kumisneru Arachchige Bandusena who resides in the village of Galwewa in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Beliatta, in the District of Hambanthota. It is hereby notified that any person/s who have a claim to or interest in the intestate property of the late late Mr. Kumisneru Arachchige Bandusena described in the Schedule hereto should submit his/their claim to the undersigned in writing before 18th August, 2025 stating his/their right or interest to such intestate property. In case of failure to do so, exparte action will be taken to register title under Section 55 (2) and (3) of the Registration of Title Act, No. 21 of 1998. P. C. D. SIGERA, Commissioner General of Land Title Settlement. Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla, 09th July, 2025. SCHEDULE Divisional Village Cadastral Parcel No. Extent of Land Certificate Office of Secretary\u2019s Division Map No. of Title No. Registration\n\n8 A\n\nIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba - 2025.08.06 PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRA ORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 06.08.2025\n\nSCHEDULE Divisional Village Cadastral Parcel No. Extent of Land Certificate Office of Secretary\u2019s Division Map No. of Title No. Registration"
