    "chunk_text": "1AI \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3: (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.08.05PART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 05.08.2025\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2448/23 \u2013 2025 \u0d85\u0dd9\u0d9c\u02a4\u0dc3\u0dca\u01b1 \u0db8\u0dc3 05 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0d85\u0d9f\u0dc4\u025e\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.08.05\n\nNo. 2448/23 \u2013 TUESDAY, AUGUST 05, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I: SECTION (I) \u2013 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Noti\ufb01cations\n\nTHE ANNUAL FEAST OF THE NATIONAL BASILICA SHRINE OF OUR LADY OF LANKATEWATTA, RAGAMA \u2013 2025\n\nGampaha District\n\nIT is hereby announced for the information of the General Public that the Annual Feast of the National Basilica Shrine of Our Lady of Lanka Tewatta, Ragama (Feast of the Patients) will be held on 31st August, 2025 and the duration of the Annual Feast will be from 24.08.2025 to 07.09.2025.\n\n1. The attention of the General Public is drawn to the Regulations published in the Gazette Noti\ufb01 cation No. 1953/43 dated 12th February 2016 under the Pilgrimage Ordinance 362 in this regard.\n\n2. These Rules and Regulations that have been promulgated shall be applicable during the period of this ceremony.\n\nL\u0d7a\u0d85\u0d82\u0d87\u0d7d\u0d7a G\u0d7a\u0d86\u0d7a\u0d80\u0d7e, District Secretary/Government Agent, Gampaha.\n\nDistrict Secretariat, Gampaha.04th August, 2025.\n\nEOG 08 \u2013 0065\n\n1A \u2013 G 045064 \u2013 05 (08/2025)\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
