    "chunk_text": "w;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2448$18 - 2025 wf.daia;= ui 05 jeks w`.yrejdod - 2025'08'05No. 2448/18 - TUESDAY, AUGUST 05, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE VALIKAMAM SOUTH WEST PRADESHIYA SABHA\n\nUnder Section 66A(1) (a) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262)\n\nWHEREAS the Office of the member of Valikamam South West Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of Resignation ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the Democratic Tamil National Alliance, the recognized politial party to which Selvarasa Kaseepaselvan the member belonged, was required by me under section 66A(1) (a) of the aforesaid ordinance, to decide upon the member of that Valikamam South West Pradeshiya Sabha of Ward number 05 - Sillalai who belongs to such party and is not disqualified under section 9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) and who shall be declared elected as a member within a period of thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized political party has communicated his decision to nominate Shanmugam Krishnalingam to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Rajendra Saseelan, Returning Officer of the Valikamam South West Pradeshiya Sabha, acting in terms of section 6A(1) (a) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare that Shanmugam Krishnalingam was elected as the member of the ward number 05 - Sillalai of Valikamam South West Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\nR. Saseelan, Returning Officer, Valikamam South West Pradeshiya Sabha.District Elections Office,Jaffna,05th August, 2025.\n\nEOG 08-0064\n\n1A- G 45063 - 09 (08/2025) This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
