    "chunk_text": "w;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2448$17 - 2025 wf.daia;= ui 05 jeks w`yyrejdod - 2025'08'05No. 2448/17 - TUESDAY, AUGUST 05, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF THE MEMBER OF MANMUNAI PATTU PRADESHIYA SABHA\n\nUnder Section 66A(1) (a) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262)\n\nWHEREAS the Office of the member of Manmunai Pattu Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of Death ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the Ilankai Tamil Arasu Kadchi the recognized politial party to which Sellathurai Manikkarasa the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66A(1) (a) of the aforesaid Ordinance, to decide upon the member of that Manmunai Pattu Pradeshiya Sabha of Ward Number 04 Arayampathy South who belongs to such party and is not disqualified under Section 9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) and who shall be declared elected as a member within a period of thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized political party has communicated his decision to nominate Sujeetha Rajaravitharma to fill such a vacancy ;\n\nTHEREFORE, I, Mohideen Bawa Mohamed Sufyan, Returning Officer of the Manmunai Pattu Pradeshiya Sabha, acting in terms of Section 66A(1) (a) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare that ward Number 04 Arayampathy South was elected as the member of the Sujeetha Rajaravitharma of Manmunai Pattu Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\nM. B. M. Sufyan, Returning Officer, Manmunai Pattu Pradeshiya Sabha.District Elections Office,Batticaloa,31st July, 2025.\n\nEOG 08 - 0063\n\n1A- G 45062 - 09 (08/2025) This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
