    "chunk_text": "02. Lot No. 365 Name of the Land: Pihillegedarawatte; Current land use : Open bare land; Claimant: Welakonawatte Walawwe Senanayake Senavirathne Herath Mudiyanselage Chandrawathi Kumarihami of Pihillegedarawatte, Meegahakivula; Reference to old Lots: F.V.P. 613 lots (blocks) No. 325; Extent: 0.0034 Hectare.\n\nAll those who claim ownership, interest and any other connection to aforesaid land, should appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at Meegahakiula Divisional Secretariat on 24th September, 2025 at 10.30 a.m.\n\nIn addition, hereby requested to notify to me in writing with two copies of the nature of their interests in the lands,\n\n2 A III \u0dba\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dda \u0dd2 \u0dc0 \u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dba \u0d9c \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba - 2025.08.02 Part III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 02.08.2025\n\nthe particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said lands, the amount of compensation and the details of computation of such amount before 17th September, 2025.\n\nS. M. N. Kumuduni, Divisional Secretary, Meegahakiula. On 28th July, 2025, At Divisional Secretariat, Megahakiula. EOG 08 - 0024\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice Under Section 7\n\nLand Ministry Ref. No. : LD/05/2005/H/393.\n\nMy Ref. No.: DS/MG/LND/04/12/08.\n\nAcquisition of Land for the Development of Roeberry Rural Hospital\n\nI hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act as amended by the Land Acquisition (amendment) Act No. 28 of 1964 the land/servitude described below is required by the government and government intends to acquire the said land for a public purpose."
