    "chunk_text": "I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act as amended by the Land Acquisition (amendment) Act No. 28 of 1964 the land/servitude described below is required by the government and government intends to acquire the said land for a public purpose.\n\nSchedule P.P.B. 606 - Lot Number 1 - Extent 1.4050 Hectare Name of the Land: Kotiyagasthenna or Kokatiyagasthenna; Current land use : Garden, with three Jak trees of 18-30 years old, thirty Turpentine trees of 16-20 years old, one Teak tree of 16 years old, six permanent buildings, five water tanks; Name, address and deed number of the Claimant: State, Other particulars: Acquired to government under the Section 38(a) of the Land Acquisition Act, Original Claimant is Madulsima Plantations Limited Company. Required for the development of Roeberry Rural Hospital. The institution which constructed the buildings and water tanks cannot be found, for completing the acquiring activities.\n\nP.P.B. 606 - Lot Number 2 - Extent 0.0773 Hectare Name of the Land: \u2014; Current land use : Road; Name, address and deed number of the Claimant: State, Other particulars: Acquired to government under the Section 38(a) of the Land Acquisition Act, Original Claimant is Madulsima Plantations Limited Company. Required for the development of Roeberry Rural Hospital, for completing the acquiring activities.\n\nP.P.B. 606 - Lot Number 3 - Extent 0.0254 Hectare Name of the Land: \u2014; Current land use : Road; Name, address and deed number of the Claimant: State, Other particulars: Acquired to government under the Section 38(a) of the Land Acquisition Act, Original Claimant is Madulsima Plantations Limited Company\u2019 Required for the development of Roeberry Rural Hospital, for completing the acquiring activities."
