    "chunk_text": "3 A III \u0dc1\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0d9a\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc1\u0dda \u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dc2 \u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba \u2013 2025.08.01 Part III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRA ORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 01.08.2025\n\nNOTICE CALLING FOR CLAIMS TO\n\nLAND PARCELS\n\nRegistration of Title Act, No. 21 of 1998\n\n(Section 12)\n\nNOTICE No. : 81/0472 GALLE DISTRICT\n\nThe Cadastral Map No. 810277 referred to above may be perused at the relevant Grama Niladhari Office, Divisional Secretariat, District Survey Office, Office of the Commissioner of Title Settlement, or the Surveyor - General\u2019s office.\n\nFurther information may be obtained from the Grama Niladhari, the Divisional Secretary, or the Commissioner of Title Settlement.\n\nP.C.D. Sigera, Commissioner General of Land Title Settlement.\n\nLand Title Settlement Department, No.1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla, 11th July, 2025. EOG 08 - 0016/5\n\nNOTICE CALLING FOR CLAIMS TO\n\nLAND PARCELS\n\nRegistration of Title Act, No. 21 of 1998\n\n(Section 12)\n\nNOTICE No. : 81/0471 GALLE DISTRICT\n\nIt is hereby notified that any person having a claim to the ownership or possession or interest to one or more of the parcels of lands reflected in the Cadastral Map No. 810278 made by the Surveyor-General under Section 11 of the Registration of Title Act, No. 21 of 1998 relating to the village of Unawatuna (Block 03, Sheet No. 04) or any part thereof, situated within the Grama Niladhari Division of No.137C - Bonavistawa in the Divisional Secretariat Division of Habaraduwa in the District of Galle in the Province of Southern should submit his claim to the undersigned before 11th of August 2025 In the event of failure to submit any claim before the above-mentioned date, action will be taken to hold an ex parte inquiry to determine title to the land and\n\naccordingly publish such determination in the Government Gazette in terms of Section 14 of the above Act."
