    "chunk_text": "EOG 08 - 0011/19 NOTICE CALLING FOR CLAIMS TO LAND PARCELS Registration of Title Act, No. 21 of 1998 (Section 12) NOTICE No : 92/0042 Kilinochchi District It is hereby notified that any person having a claim to the ownership or possession or interest to one or more of the parcels of lands reflected in the Cadastral Map No. 920095 made by the Surveyor-General under Section 11 of the Registration of Title Act, No. 21 of 1998 relating to the village of Pallavarayankaddu (Block 12, Sheet No. 02) or any part thereof, situated within the Grama Niladhari Division of No.KN73 - Mulankavil in the Divisional Secretariat Division of Poonakary in the District of Kilinochchi in the Province of Nothern should submit his claim to the undersigned before 18th of August 2025 In the event of failure"
