    "chunk_text": "1AIII \u0d9a\u0ddc\u02c1\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dba\u0dda\u024f \u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dd9\u02e4\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba \u2013 2025.07.01PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 01.07.2025\n\n\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dba\u0dda\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dbaThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dd9\u02e4\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d82\u0d9a 2447/55 \u2013 2025 \u0d85\u0d9c\u0ddd\ufffd\u0ddd\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0dc3 01 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0dc3\u0dd2\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.08.01No. 2447/55 \u2013 FRIDAY, AUGAST 01, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDSPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, the Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation, do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land described below is needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.\n\nAll that allotment of land depicted in the Advance Tracing No. KU/NRM/2022/95 dated 25.09.2022, prepared by the Surveyor General , situated at the Village of Paranagama (FVP 566), in No. 1036 Paranagama Grama Niladhari Division, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Narammala in the District of Kurunegala in the North Western Province and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot No. 01 \u2013 Nedungolla and Paluwatta alias Nedungollawatta \u2013 Extent: About 1.7307 Hectares North : Channel (dry); East: Road (Pradeshiya Sabha); South: Road (Pradeshiya Sabha); West: Road (Pradeshiya Sabha).\n\nK. D. Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation.\n\nMy No.: 4-3/18/2021/WS/312.Ministry of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d,Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla,20th May, 2025.\n\nEOG 08 \u2013 0006\n\n1A \u2013 G 045013 \u2013 14 (08/2025)This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
