    "chunk_text": "Boundaries: North: Aliyawatta claimed by S. K. Wijerathne; East: Aliyawatta claimed by S. K. Wijerathne; South: Canal road and Aliyawatta claimed by N. T. Anoma Vineethamala; West: Aliyawatta claimed by N. T. Anoma Vineethamala and Aliyawatta claimed by S. K. Wijerathne. All persons who claim ownership, interest or any other connection to the aforesaid land hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me on October 15th 2025, at 10.00 a.m. at the Divisional Secretariat, Medadumbara.\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - G 045012 - 14 (08/2025)\n\n2 A III \u0dd9\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba - 2025.08.01 P\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d8d III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 01.08.2025\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nFurther, you are hereby requested to notify me in writing in duplicate before October 08th 2025, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land the\n\namount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount. Title deeds shall be presented at the inquiry. N\u0d8e\u0d90\u0d7a\u0d87 C. H\u0d7e\u0d86\u0d7a\u0d84\u0d8e\u0d86\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d7a, Divisional Secretary, Medadumbara. 30th July, 2025, Divisional Secretariat, Medadumbara. EOG 08 - 0005"
