atio within the range of 0% - 2% compared to the previous year. (d) Performance marks allocated for the respective criterion will be given proportionately, if the NPL has been maintained between 5% to the Bank\u2019s actual NPL ratio. 5.2.2. The overall Performance marks for bank employees shall be computed as follows;\n\n\u2022 For Branch Employees"
