d leave. 34.1 EPF and ETF contributions will be made on holiday pay and encashed accumulated leave in terms of relevant legislation\u2019s and the EPF code. 35. Payment of day\u2019s pay for holiday work 35.1 Action will be taken to grant lieu leave for working on weekends or public holidays."
