Divisional Secretariat O\ufb03 ce located at Sekkuwatta and Road (R.D.A.); East: Road (R.D.A.); South: Road (R.D.A.) and Road; West: Road and Lot B.\n\nK. D. Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation.\n\nMy No.: 4-3/3/2023/HW/262.Ministry of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d,Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla.19th June, 2025.\n\nEOG 07 \u2013 0363\n\n1A \u2013 G 044988 \u2013 10 (07/2025)\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
