    "chunk_text": "w;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2447$28 - 2025 cQ,s ui 30 jeks nodod - 2025'07'30No. 2447/28 - WEDNESDAY, JULY 30, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE VALIKAMAM WEST PRADESHIYA SABHA UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of return member of Valikamam West Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of Resignation;\n\nAnd whereas the Secretary of the Eelam People's Democratic Party, the recognized political party to which Sivaguru Balakrishnan the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66A(1) of the aforesaid ordinance, to decide upon returned member of Valikamam West Pradeshiya Sabha who belongs to such party and is not disqualified under section 9 of the local authorities elections ordinance (Chapter 262) and who shall be declared selected as a member within a period of thirty (30) days;\n\nAnd whereas the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized political party has communicated his decision to nominate Sellamuthu Selvakkumar to fill such vacancy;\n\nNow Therefore I, Rajendra Saseelan, returning officer of the Valikamam West Pradeshiya Sabha, acting in terms of Section 66A (1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare that Sellamuthu Selvakkumar was selected as the member of the Valikamam West Pradeshiya Sabha. R. Saseelan, Returning Officer, Valikamam West Pradeshiya Sabha. District Elections Office,Jaffna,24th July, 2025.\n\nEOG 07 - 0362\n\n1A- G 44987 - 09 (07/2025) This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SIR LANKA."
