    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2447/27 - 2025 \u0da2\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dd2 \u0db8\u0dc3 30 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.07.30\n\nNo. 2447/27 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, JULY 30, 2025 - 30.07.2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority) PART III \u2014 LANDS Land Acquisition Notices\n\n1A - G 044986 - 11 (07/2025) This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460) Notice under Section 7 D. S. Ref. No.: 856-3/2/3/10/275. Ministry of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation Ref. No.: 4-3/7/2021/HW/360.\n\nAs the Government intends to acquire the following lands/servitudes required for a public purpose, I hereby notified under Sub-Section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964 Details of the land / servitude expected to be acquired : Four allotments in total extent of about 0.0445 Hectare, of land in Cadastral Map No. 510614, Block No. 02 and Sheet No. 07 prepared by the Senior Superintendent of Surveys of Gampola District on behalf of the Surveyor General, situated in the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 328, Paththalagedara in Village of Paththalagedara in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Attanagalla in Gampaha District in the Western Province."
