    "chunk_text": "As the Government intends to acquire the following lands/servitudes required for a public purpose, I hereby notified under Sub-Section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964 Details of the land / servitude expected to be acquired : Four allotments in total extent of about 0.0445 Hectare, of land in Cadastral Map No. 510614, Block No. 02 and Sheet No. 07 prepared by the Senior Superintendent of Surveys of Gampola District on behalf of the Surveyor General, situated in the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 328, Paththalagedara in Village of Paththalagedara in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Attanagalla in Gampaha District in the Western Province.\n\n2 A III \u0dd9\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba - 2025.07.30 P\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d8d III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 30.07.2025\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\n(to finalize the land acquisition process); Extent : 0.0078 Hectare All persons interested in the aforesaid lands are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat Office of Attanagalla on the 15th August of 2025 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 07th of August 2025 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said lands, the\n\namount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount. S. P. Gunawardana, Divisional Secretary, and Land Acquiring Officer, Attanagalla. Divisional Secretariat, Attanagalla, 28th day of July, 2025.\n\nEOG 07 - 0361"
